  "prompt": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Phần nửa mặt phẳng bờ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> không bị gạch ở hình vẽ sau là miền nghiệm của bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Giá trị của biểu thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></semantics></math> bằng bao nhiêu?</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/a7659da8bc9c8815650b22b6a3dbbbed36f1d2c601714e91cd758744ec80e02d.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
  "choices": [],
  "correct": "0",
  "solution": "Đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> đi qua hai điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> có phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> thuộc miền nghiệm, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó hình vẽ trên minh họa cho miền nghiệm (tính cả bờ) của bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
